      "id": "claim_bf24f99ca8ac47f198ca347641763977",
      "statement": "SecurityConfig defines two SecurityFilterChain beans: an actuator chain (order 1, /actuator/**) using HTTP Basic with InMemoryUserDetailsManager, and an MCP chain (order 2, /mcp/** + /sse) using bearer token authentication with CSRF disabled and HTTP Basic explicitly disabled.",
